					"expression": "{{if:l==2|{{h}} {{h}}|{{if:l==3|{{h}} {{h}} {{h}}|{{h}} {{h}} {{h}} {{h}}}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "D",
					"expression": "{{if:t==0|{{if:l==2|{{eval:h-1}} {{eval:h-1}}|{{if:l==3|{{eval:h-1}} {{eval:h-1}} {{eval:h-1}}|{{eval:h-1}} {{eval:h-1}} {{eval:h-1}} {{eval:h-1}}}}}}|{{if:l==3|{{h}} {{h}} 0|{{h}} {{h}} {{h}} 0}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "H",
					"expression": "{{if:p==2|{{R}} / {{D}}|{{R}} / {{R}} / {{D}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "M",
					"expression": "{{if:t==0|{{l}}|{{h}}}}"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:l*p*h-M}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Le pavé complet.** Il aurait ${{l}} \\times {{p}} \\times {{h}} = {{eval:l*p*h}}$ cubes.",
					"{{if:t==0|Il manque, devant en haut, une rangée de ${{l}}$ cubes|Il manque la pile de devant à droite, de ${{h}}$ cubes}} : ${{eval:l*p*h}} - {{M}} = {{eval:l*p*h-M}}$ cubes.",
					"Un cube d'arête $1~\\unit{cm}$ a un volume de $1~\\unit{cm^3}$. Le volume est $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:l*p*h-M}}~\\unit{cm^3}}$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
